#: transparent-edge-cache.php:162
msgid "Transparent Edge Cache — cache fragmentation fixed"
msgstr "Transparent Edge Cache — fragmentación de caché corregida"

#: transparent-edge-cache.php:163
msgid ""
"This update turned off Vary: X-Device and Vary: Accept-Language, which were "
"splitting your edge cache into extra copies without serving different "
"content (they were hurting your hit ratio). If your site genuinely serves "
"different HTML for the same URL per device or per browser language, you can "
"switch them back on under TE Cache → Cache."
msgstr ""
"Esta actualización ha desactivado Vary: X-Device y Vary: Accept-Language, "
"que dividían tu caché de edge en copias extra sin servir contenido distinto "
"(perjudicaban tu hit ratio). Si tu sitio sirve HTML distinto para la misma "
"URL por dispositivo o por idioma del navegador, puedes volver a activarlos "
"en TE Cache → Caché."

#: transparent-edge-cache.php:179
msgid "Every 30 minutes (Transparent Edge)"
msgstr "Cada 30 minutos (Transparent Edge)"

