#: includes/modules/TE_ObjectCache.php:121
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Transparent Edge Cache: the object cache drop-in (%s) is installed but its "
"server is not answering — it is NOT caching persistently (every request "
"recomputes against the database). Start the service or switch backend."
msgstr ""
"Transparent Edge Cache: el drop-in de object cache (%s) está instalado pero "
"su servidor no responde — NO está cacheando de forma persistente (cada "
"petición se recalcula contra la base de datos). Arranca el servicio o cambia"
" de backend."

