"Redis server running, but PHP extension (phpredis) is not installed. Install"
" it with: sudo apt install php-redis && sudo systemctl restart php-fpm"
msgstr ""
"Servidor Redis activo, pero la extensión PHP (phpredis) no está instalada. "
"Instálala con: sudo apt install php-redis && sudo systemctl restart php-fpm"

#: includes/modules/TE_ObjectCache.php:283
msgid ""
"the Memcached PHP extension is installed but no server answered here. Start "
"memcached, or point WP_MEMCACHED_HOST / WP_MEMCACHED_PORT at a running one."
msgstr ""
"la extensión PHP Memcached está instalada pero ningún servidor respondió "
"aquí. Arranca memcached, o apunta WP_MEMCACHED_HOST / WP_MEMCACHED_PORT a "
"uno en marcha."

#: includes/modules/TE_ObjectCache.php:303
msgid ""
"Memcached server running, but the PHP extension is not installed. Install it"
" with: sudo apt install php-memcached && sudo systemctl restart php-fpm"
msgstr ""
"Servidor Memcached en marcha, pero la extensión PHP no está instalada. "
"Instálala con: sudo apt install php-memcached && sudo systemctl restart php-"
"fpm"

