#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:324
msgid "🗑️ Purge All Cache"
msgstr "🗑️ Purgar Toda la Caché"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:327
msgid "🔄 Preload Cache via Sitemap"
msgstr "🔄 Precalentar Caché vía Sitemap"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:330
msgid "⏹ Stop Preload"
msgstr "⏹ Detener Precalentamiento"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:339
msgid "Cache Headers"
msgstr "Cabeceras de Caché"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:340
msgid ""
"Control how Varnish and browsers cache your content. s-maxage is the CDN TTL"
" (Varnish), max-age is for visitors' browsers."
msgstr ""
"Controla cómo cachean tu contenido Varnish y los navegadores. s-maxage es el"
" TTL de la CDN (Varnish); max-age es para el navegador de los visitantes."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:344
msgid "Enable Cache Headers"
msgstr "Activar Cabeceras de Caché"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:345
msgid "Send Cache-Control, Surrogate-Keys, and Vary headers"
msgstr "Enviar cabeceras Cache-Control, Surrogate-Keys y Vary"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:349
msgid "Dynamic Content (HTML)"
msgstr "Contenido Dinámico (HTML)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:353
msgid ""
"Pages, posts, archives, REST API — generated by PHP. These headers are sent "
"by the plugin directly."
msgstr ""
"Páginas, posts, archivos, REST API — generados por PHP. Estas cabeceras se "
"envían directamente desde el plugin."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:357
#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:389
#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:498
msgid "CDN TTL (s-maxage)"
msgstr "TTL CDN (s-maxage)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:360
msgid "seconds. Default: 172800 (48h). How long Varnish keeps HTML pages."
msgstr ""
"segundos. Por defecto: 172800 (48h). Cuánto tiempo Varnish mantiene las "
"páginas HTML."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:364
#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:396
#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:505
msgid "Browser TTL (max-age)"
msgstr "TTL Navegador (max-age)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:367
msgid "seconds. Default: 3600 (1h). Reduces unnecessary checks to CDN nodes."
msgstr ""
"segundos. Por defecto: 3600 (1h). Reduce chequeos innecesarios a nodos CDN."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:372
msgid "Homepage (front page)"
msgstr "Portada (página de inicio)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:376
msgid ""
"The homepage is the most-requested URL and the one that must never fall back"
" to the origin. Give it its own policy — a short fresh window plus a "
"generous stale-while-revalidate — so an expiry is served stale instantly "
"while a single request revalidates behind it, instead of a miss storm. When "
"off, the homepage uses the global HTML profile above."
msgstr ""
"La portada es la URL más solicitada y la que nunca debe caer al origen. Dale"
" su propia política —una ventana de frescura corta más un stale-while-"
"revalidate generoso— para que, al expirar, se sirva stale al instante "
"mientras una sola petición revalida por detrás, en lugar de una tormenta de "
"miss. Si está desactivado, la portada usa el perfil HTML global de arriba."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:380
msgid "Dedicated homepage profile"
msgstr "Perfil dedicado de portada"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:384
msgid "Use these values for the homepage instead of the global HTML TTLs"
msgstr "Usar estos valores para la portada en lugar de los TTL HTML globales"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:392
msgid "seconds. Default: 300 (5 min). Short fresh window for a news homepage."
msgstr ""
"segundos. Por defecto: 300 (5 min). Ventana de frescura corta para una "
"portada de noticias."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:399
msgid "seconds. Default: 30. Low so breaking news is picked up quickly."
msgstr "segundos. Por defecto: 30. Bajo para recoger rápido la última hora."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:403
msgid "Stale-while-revalidate"
msgstr "Stale-while-revalidate"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:406
msgid ""
"seconds. Default: 300. After expiry the edge serves the stale homepage "
"instantly and a single request revalidates behind it — this is what shields "
"a weak origin."
msgstr ""
"segundos. Por defecto: 300. Tras expirar, el edge sirve la portada stale al "
"instante y una sola petición revalida por detrás — esto es lo que protege a "
"un origen débil."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:410
msgid "Stale-if-error"
msgstr "Stale-if-error"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:413
msgid ""
"seconds. Default: 86400 (24h). Airbag: if the origin returns 5xx, serve the "
"last good homepage instead of an error."
msgstr ""
"segundos. Por defecto: 86400 (24h). Airbag: si el origen devuelve 5xx, sirve"
" la última portada buena en lugar de un error."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:420
msgid ""
"Serve-stale VCL (grace / keep) — propose-only, makes stale-while-revalidate "
"actually work"
msgstr ""
"VCL de servir-stale (grace / keep) — solo propuesta, hace que stale-while-"
"revalidate funcione de verdad"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:421
msgid ""
"The homepage profile sends stale-while-revalidate and stale-if-error, but "
"Varnish only serves stale during revalidation when grace/keep match. This "
"snippet derives them from the Cache-Control the plugin sends, so they stay "
"in sync. The plugin never deploys VCL — copy it into Configuration → VCL."
msgstr ""
"El perfil de portada envía stale-while-revalidate y stale-if-error, pero "
"Varnish solo sirve stale durante la revalidación si grace/keep coinciden. "
"Este snippet los deriva del Cache-Control que envía el plugin, para que se "
"mantengan sincronizados. El plugin nunca despliega VCL — cópialo en "
"Configuration → VCL."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:423
#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:954
#: includes/admin/views/tab-security.php:130
#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:133
msgid "Copy VCL"
msgstr "Copiar VCL"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:430
msgid "Origin page cache (serves HTML before WordPress boots)"
msgstr "Page cache de origen (sirve HTML antes de que arranque WordPress)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:434
msgid ""
"On a CDN miss the edge still has to fetch from the origin. This serves a "
"pre-rendered copy of anonymous pages before WordPress boots, so that fetch "
"does not regenerate WordPress. Enable/disable it from the Page Cache card at"
" the top. Logged-in users, and any URL or cookie in your exclusions, are "
"never page-cached."
msgstr ""
"Ante un miss de CDN, el edge sigue teniendo que ir al origen. Esto sirve una"
" copia pre-renderizada de las páginas anónimas antes de que arranque "
"WordPress, de modo que ese fetch no regenera WordPress. Actívala o "
"desactívala desde la tarjeta Page Cache de arriba. Los usuarios logados, y "
"cualquier URL o cookie de tus exclusiones, nunca se cachean en página."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:438
msgid "Storage backend"
msgstr "Backend de almacenamiento"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:443
msgid "Disk (default)"
msgstr "Disco (por defecto)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:444
msgid ""
"Zero dependencies, works anywhere. Each lookup is a filesystem read, so on "
"slow or network disk (NFS) and under very high concurrency the I/O and stat "
"cost shows, and lookups index slower than an in-memory store."
msgstr ""
"Cero dependencias, funciona en cualquier sitio. Cada lectura es un acceso a "
"disco, así que en discos lentos o de red (NFS) y con mucha concurrencia se "
"nota el coste de E/S y de stat, y el indexado es más lento que en un almacén"
" en memoria."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:448
msgid "Redis"
msgstr "Redis"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:449
#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:455
msgid "Available"
msgstr "Disponible"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:449
msgid ""
"Redis detected but password-protected — set WP_REDIS_PASSWORD in wp-"
"config.php."
msgstr ""
"Redis detectado pero protegido con contraseña — define WP_REDIS_PASSWORD en "
"wp-config.php."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:449
msgid ""
"Redis server detected, but the phpredis extension is not installed — "
"selecting this would cache nothing."
msgstr ""
"Servidor Redis detectado, pero la extensión phpredis no está instalada — "
"seleccionarlo no cachearía nada."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:449
msgid ""
"Redis is configured but not answering — start the service or check "
"WP_REDIS_HOST / WP_REDIS_PORT."
msgstr ""
"Redis está configurado pero no responde — arranca el servicio o revisa "
"WP_REDIS_HOST / WP_REDIS_PORT."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:449
msgid "Not available on this server — selecting this would cache nothing."
msgstr "No disponible en este servidor — seleccionarlo no cachearía nada."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:450
msgid ""
"In-memory key lookup, no disk I/O: faster under concurrency and better at "
"indexing than disk. Reuses your WP_REDIS_* settings. Requires the Redis "
"service and the phpredis extension."
msgstr ""
"Búsqueda de claves en memoria, sin E/S de disco: más rápido con concurrencia"
" y mejor en el indexado que el disco. Reutiliza tu configuración WP_REDIS_*."
" Requiere el servicio Redis y la extensión phpredis."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:454
msgid "Memcached"
msgstr "Memcached"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:455
msgid ""
"Memcached server detected, but the PHP extension is not installed — "
"selecting this would cache nothing."
msgstr ""
"Servidor Memcached detectado, pero la extensión PHP no está instalada — "
"seleccionarlo no cachearía nada."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:455
msgid ""
"Not available here — needs the Memcached PHP extension and a running server;"
" selecting it would cache nothing."
msgstr ""
"No disponible aquí — requiere la extensión PHP Memcached y un servidor en "
"marcha; seleccionarlo no cachearía nada."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:456
msgid ""
"Same in-memory advantage as Redis; its flush is generation-based so it never"
" wipes a store shared with the object cache. Requires the Memcached service "
"and extension."
msgstr ""
"La misma ventaja en memoria que Redis; su flush se basa en generaciones, así"
" que nunca borra un almacén compartido con el object cache. Requiere el "
"servicio Memcached y la extensión."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:459
msgid ""
"Change the backend, then toggle the Page Cache off and on from the card "
"above to apply it."
msgstr ""
"Cambia el backend y luego desactiva y vuelve a activar la Page Cache desde "
"la tarjeta de arriba para aplicarlo."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:463
msgid "Page cache TTL"
msgstr "TTL de la page cache"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:466
msgid ""
"seconds. Default: 300. It is only a fallback for edge misses, so a short "
"value is fine; a purge clears it anyway."
msgstr ""
"segundos. Por defecto: 300. Solo es una red de seguridad para los miss del "
"edge, así que un valor corto está bien; una purga la limpia de todos modos."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:471
msgid "Object cache (protects logged-in users and wp-admin)"
msgstr "Object cache (protege a usuarios logueados y wp-admin)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:475
msgid ""
"Page cache only covers anonymous visitors. Your editors, and every wp-admin "
"and admin-ajax request, bypass it and hit the database directly. A "
"persistent object cache (Redis or Memcached) absorbs that load. Without one,"
" a busy newsroom can overwhelm MySQL even with page cache on."
msgstr ""
"La page cache solo cubre a las visitas anónimas. Tu redacción, y cada "
"petición de wp-admin y admin-ajax, la saltan y pegan directamente a la base "
"de datos. Un object cache persistente (Redis o Memcached) absorbe esa carga."
" Sin él, una redacción intensa puede saturar MySQL incluso con la page cache"
" activada."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:479
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Automático"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:483
msgid ""
"Enable the object cache automatically when a live memory backend (Redis or "
"Memcached) is detected"
msgstr ""
"Activar el object cache automáticamente cuando se detecte un backend de "
"memoria vivo (Redis o Memcached)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:485
msgid ""
"Recommended. When off, you must enable the object cache by hand from the "
"card at the top. It never overwrites an object-cache.php from another plugin"
" without your confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Recomendado. Si está desactivado, debes activar el object cache a mano desde"
" la tarjeta de arriba. Nunca sobrescribe un object-cache.php de otro plugin "
"sin tu confirmación."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:490
msgid "Static Resources (CSS, JS, images, fonts, video)"
msgstr "Recursos Estáticos (CSS, JS, imágenes, fuentes, vídeo)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:494
msgid ""
"Static files are served by the web server, not PHP. The plugin sets Cache-"
"Control headers so Varnish respects these TTLs from the origin. When assets "
"change (media uploads, theme/plugin updates), the plugin invalidates them "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Los archivos estáticos los sirve el servidor web, no PHP. El plugin "
"configura las cabeceras Cache-Control para que Varnish respete estos TTLs "
"del origen. Cuando los recursos cambian (subida de media, actualización de "
"tema/plugin), el plugin los invalida automáticamente."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:501
msgid "seconds. Default: 2592000 (30 days)."
msgstr "segundos. Por defecto: 2592000 (30 días)."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:508
msgid "seconds. Default: 86400 (1 day)."
msgstr "segundos. Por defecto: 86400 (1 día)."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:515
msgid "Server:"
msgstr "Servidor:"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:529
msgid "Nginx config snippet (add to your server {} block)"
msgstr "Snippet Nginx (añadir al bloque server {})"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:534
msgid "📋 Copy"
msgstr "📋 Copiar"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:541
msgid ""
"Static asset invalidation is automatic: media uploads, theme and plugin "
"updates trigger Varnish purge. WordPress version strings (?ver=X) on CSS/JS "
"handle browser cache-busting."
msgstr ""
"La invalidación de recursos estáticos es automática: la subida de media y "
"las actualizaciones de temas y plugins disparan la purga en Varnish. Las "
"versiones de WordPress (?ver=X) en CSS/JS gestionan la renovación en el "
"navegador."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:547
msgid "Cache Variants"
msgstr "Variantes de Caché"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:550
msgid "Surrogate-Keys"
msgstr "Surrogate-Keys"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:551
msgid ""
"Tag every page with content identifiers for surgical cache invalidation"
msgstr ""
"Etiquetar cada página con identificadores de contenido para invalidación "
"quirúrgica"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:554
msgid "Vary by Device"
msgstr "Variar por Dispositivo"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:555
msgid "Separate cache for mobile and desktop (uses X-Device header)"
msgstr "Caché separada para móvil y escritorio (usa cabecera X-Device)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:558
msgid "Vary by Language"
msgstr "Variar por Idioma"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:559
msgid "Separate cache per language (enable if using WPML/Polylang)"
msgstr "Caché separada por idioma (activar si usa WPML/Polylang)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:566
msgid "Cache Invalidation"
msgstr "Invalidación de Caché"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:567
msgid ""
"Configure when and how cached content is automatically purged from the CDN."
msgstr ""
"Configura cuándo y cómo se purga automáticamente el contenido cacheado del "
"CDN."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:571
msgid "Auto-invalidation"
msgstr "Auto-invalidación"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:572
msgid "Automatically purge cache when content changes"
msgstr "Purgar automáticamente la caché cuando cambia el contenido"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:575
msgid "Invalidation Method"
msgstr "Método de Invalidación"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:578
msgid "Soft Purge (recommended — serves stale if origin fails)"
msgstr "Soft Purge (recomendado — sirve contenido antiguo si el origen falla)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:579
msgid "Hard Purge (immediately removes from cache)"
msgstr "Hard Purge (elimina inmediatamente de la caché)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:584
msgid "Refetch after purge"
msgstr "Refetch tras purga"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:585
msgid "Warm up cache immediately after invalidation (no cold MISSes)"
msgstr ""
"Precalentar caché inmediatamente tras invalidación (sin MISSes en frío)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:588
msgid "Warm method"
msgstr "Método de warm-up"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:591
msgid "Platform refetch (recommended — warms every edge node, origin-safe)"
msgstr ""
"Refetch de plataforma (recomendado — calienta todos los nodos, seguro para "
"el origen)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:592
msgid "Origin GET (fallback — only warms one node)"
msgstr "GET al origen (fallback — solo calienta un nodo)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:594
msgid ""
"Refetch re-warms the changed URLs on the whole edge in one call; the "
"platform refetchers aggregate the origin fetches, so your origin sees one or"
" two requests instead of one per node. It needs no MidTier. The origin GET "
"is used automatically as a fallback when the API is unavailable."
msgstr ""
"El refetch recalienta las URLs cambiadas en todo el edge con una sola "
"llamada; los nodos refetcher de la plataforma agregan las peticiones al "
"origen, así que tu origen ve una o dos en vez de una por nodo. No necesita "
"MidTier. El GET al origen se usa automáticamente como fallback cuando la API"
" no está disponible."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:598
msgid "Purge triggers"
msgstr "Disparadores de purga"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:601
msgid "Posts & Pages"
msgstr "Posts y Páginas"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:602
msgid "Purge when a post, page, or CPT is published, updated, or deleted"
msgstr "Purgar cuando un post, página o CPT se publica, actualiza o elimina"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:605
msgid "Comments"
msgstr "Comentarios"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:606
msgid "Purge when a new comment is approved or edited"
msgstr "Purgar cuando un nuevo comentario es aprobado o editado"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:609
msgid "Menus"
msgstr "Menús"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:610
msgid "Purge when a navigation menu is updated"
msgstr "Purgar cuando un menú de navegación se actualiza"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:613
msgid "Widgets"
msgstr "Widgets"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:614
msgid "Purge when sidebar widgets are updated"
msgstr "Purgar cuando los widgets de la barra lateral se actualizan"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:617
msgid "Theme Switch"
msgstr "Cambio de Tema"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:618
msgid "Full purge when the active theme is changed"
msgstr "Purga completa cuando se cambia el tema activo"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:621
msgid "Plugin Changes"
msgstr "Cambios de Plugins"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:622
msgid "Full purge when any plugin is activated or deactivated"
msgstr "Purga completa cuando se activa o desactiva cualquier plugin"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:625
msgid "Cache warming"
msgstr "Calentamiento de caché"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:628
msgid "Preload via Sitemap"
msgstr "Precargar vía Sitemap"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:630
msgid ""
"Crawl the sitemap after a full purge to warm the CDN cache (no cold MISSes)"
msgstr ""
"Recorre el sitemap tras una purga total para calentar la caché de CDN (sin "
"MISSes en frío)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:631
msgid ""
"A bulk warm of the whole site. It is throttled and gated so it never "
"overloads the origin — see the controls below."
msgstr ""
"Un calentamiento masivo de todo el sitio. Está limitado y controlado para no"
" sobrecargar nunca el origen — mira los controles de abajo."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:635
msgid "Preload method"
msgstr "Método de preload"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:638
msgid "Refetch (recommended — origin-aggregated, safe for weak origins)"
msgstr ""
"Refetch (recomendado — agregado en origen, seguro para orígenes débiles)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:639
msgid ""
"Prefetch (populates without evicting, but fans out ~1 fetch per node — "
"strong origins only)"
msgstr ""
"Prefetch (puebla sin invalidar, pero hace fan-out de ~1 petición por nodo — "
"solo orígenes fuertes)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:641
msgid ""
"Refetch collapses the origin fetches through the refetcher nodes (origin "
"sees one or two per URL). Prefetch warms every node directly, so each node "
"fetches from the origin — only choose it if your origin can take one request"
" per edge node per URL."
msgstr ""
"El refetch colapsa las peticiones al origen a través de los nodos refetcher "
"(el origen ve una o dos por URL). El prefetch calienta cada nodo "
"directamente, así que cada nodo pega al origen — elígelo solo si tu origen "
"aguanta una petición por nodo de edge y URL."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:645
msgid "Adaptive pacing"
msgstr "Ritmo adaptativo"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:647
msgid "Auto-tune the warm-up speed to what the origin can take"
msgstr "Auto-ajusta la velocidad del calentado a lo que el origen aguanta"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:648
msgid ""
"Ramps the batch size up while the origin keeps up (its latency stays near "
"its own baseline) and the page-cache disk has headroom, and cuts it back "
"when the origin starts to slow, the platform rate-limits, or the disk runs "
"low. It tunes to the origin's real capacity whatever its speed. The "
"guardrails (health gate, backoff, off-peak) are unchanged — this only moves "
"within them. Ideal for sites with thousands of URLs."
msgstr ""
"Sube el tamaño de lote mientras el origen aguanta (su latencia se mantiene "
"cerca de su propia línea base) y la page cache tiene hueco de disco, y lo "
"recorta cuando el origen empieza a ir lento, la plataforma hace rate-limit o"
" el disco se queda sin espacio. Se ajusta a la capacidad real del origen sea"
" cual sea su velocidad. Los guardarraíles (control de salud, backoff, off-"
"peak) no cambian — esto solo se mueve dentro de ellos. Ideal para sitios con"
" miles de URLs."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:652
msgid "Origin health gate"
msgstr "Control de salud del origen"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:654
msgid ""
"Probe the origin before each batch and pause the preload if it is slow or "
"erroring"
msgstr ""
"Sondea el origen antes de cada lote y pausa el preload si va lento o da "
"errores"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:655
msgid ""
"This toggle governs the manual preload. The automatic preload after a full "
"purge is always gated, whatever this is set to, so a scheduled warm never "
"overloads the origin unattended."
msgstr ""
"Este interruptor controla el preload manual. El preload automático tras una "
"purga total va siempre protegido, esté como esté esto, para que un "
"calentamiento programado nunca sobrecargue el origen sin supervisión."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:659
msgid "Off-peak only"
msgstr "Solo en horas valle"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:661
msgid "Run the bulk preload only during an off-peak window"
msgstr "Ejecuta el preload masivo solo durante una ventana de horas valle"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:663
msgid "Window (site time, 24h):"
msgstr "Ventana (hora del sitio, 24h):"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:676
msgid ""
"Optimize images on-the-fly at the CDN edge. No processing on your server, "
"zero latency."
msgstr ""
