#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:738
msgid "Frontend Optimization"
msgstr "Optimización Frontend"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:739
msgid ""
"Optimize Core Web Vitals (LCP, INP, CLS) by controlling how assets are "
"loaded, minified, and served."
msgstr ""
"Optimiza los Core Web Vitals (LCP, INP, CLS) controlando cómo se cargan, "
"minifican y sirven los recursos."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:743
msgid "CSS"
msgstr "CSS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:746
msgid "Minify CSS"
msgstr "Minificar CSS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:749
msgid "Minify CSS files (removes comments, whitespace). Cached to disk."
msgstr ""
"Minificar archivos CSS (elimina comentarios, espacios). Caché en disco."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:750
msgid "Already-minified files (.min.css) and external CSS are skipped."
msgstr "Los archivos ya minificados (.min.css) y CSS externos se omiten."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:754
msgid "Combine CSS"
msgstr "Combinar CSS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:757
msgid "Combine local CSS files into a single file (reduces HTTP requests)"
msgstr ""
"Combinar archivos CSS locales en un solo archivo (reduce peticiones HTTP)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:758
msgid ""
"Concatenates all local stylesheets into one file. External and conditional "
"CSS are preserved. Includes minification automatically."
msgstr ""
"Concatena todas las hojas de estilo locales en un archivo. CSS externo y "
"condicional se preservan. Incluye minificación automáticamente."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:762
msgid "Remove Unused CSS"
msgstr "Eliminar CSS no usado"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:765
msgid "Serve only the CSS each page actually uses (major LCP improvement)"
msgstr "Servir solo el CSS que cada página usa realmente (gran mejora de LCP)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:766
msgid ""
"Used CSS is generated in the background per template and served inline; the "
"rest is deferred. Generation never blocks visitors, and if it fails the "
"original CSS is served unchanged."
msgstr ""
"El CSS usado se genera en segundo plano por plantilla y se sirve inline; el "
"resto se difiere. La generación nunca bloquea a los visitantes, y si falla "
"se sirve el CSS original sin cambios."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:768
msgid "Exclusions (one handle or URL fragment per line):"
msgstr "Exclusiones (un handle o fragmento de URL por línea):"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:775
msgid "JavaScript"
msgstr "JavaScript"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:778
msgid "Minify JS"
msgstr "Minificar JS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:781
msgid "Minify JS files (removes comments, extra whitespace). Cached to disk."
msgstr ""
"Minificar archivos JS (elimina comentarios, espacios extra). Caché en disco."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:782
msgid ""
"Already-minified files (.min.js), jQuery, and external scripts are skipped. "
"Conservative approach to avoid breaking JS."
msgstr ""
"Los archivos ya minificados (.min.js), jQuery y scripts externos se omiten. "
"Enfoque conservador para no romper JS."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:786
msgid "Combine JS"
msgstr "Combinar JS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:789
msgid "Combine local JS files into a single file (reduces HTTP requests)"
msgstr ""
"Combinar archivos JS locales en un solo archivo (reduce peticiones HTTP)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:790
msgid ""
"Only footer scripts are combined. jQuery, WP core, and external scripts stay"
" separate. Includes minification automatically."
msgstr ""
"Solo se combinan scripts del footer. jQuery, core WP y scripts externos se "
"mantienen separados. Incluye minificación automáticamente."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:794
msgid "Combine JS Exclusions"
msgstr "Exclusiones de Combinar JS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:797
msgid ""
"One handle or pattern per line. Scripts matching these will NOT be combined."
msgstr ""
"Un handle o patrón por línea. Los scripts que coincidan NO se combinarán."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:804
msgid "Add defer attribute to JS files (load without blocking HTML parsing)"
msgstr ""
"Añadir atributo defer a archivos JS (carga sin bloquear el parseo HTML)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:805
msgid "Improves LCP. jQuery and core WP scripts are excluded automatically."
msgstr ""
"Mejora LCP. jQuery y los scripts core de WP se excluyen automáticamente."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:809
msgid "Defer JS Exclusions"
msgstr "Exclusiones de Defer JS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:812
msgid ""
"One handle or pattern per line. Scripts matching these will NOT get defer."
msgstr ""
"Un handle o patrón por línea. Los scripts que coincidan NO tendrán defer."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:816
msgid "Delay JS Execution"
msgstr "Ejecución Retardada de JS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:819
msgid ""
"Delay non-critical JavaScript until user interaction (mouse, scroll, touch)"
msgstr ""
"Retrasar JavaScript no crítico hasta la interacción del usuario (ratón, "
"scroll, toque)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:820
msgid ""
"More aggressive than defer — scripts don't load at all until user interacts."
" Best for INP."
msgstr ""
"Más agresivo que defer — los scripts no se cargan en absoluto hasta que el "
"usuario interactúa. Ideal para INP."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:824
msgid "Delay JS Exclusions"
msgstr "Exclusiones de Delay JS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:827
msgid "One pattern per line. jQuery is always excluded."
msgstr "Un patrón por línea. jQuery siempre se excluye."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:832
msgid "Images & Media"
msgstr "Imágenes y Media"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:838
msgid "Add loading=\"lazy\" to below-the-fold images"
msgstr "Añadir loading=\"lazy\" a imágenes fuera del viewport"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:845
msgid "Add loading=\"lazy\" to iframes (YouTube, Google Maps, etc.)"
msgstr "Añadir loading=\"lazy\" a iframes (YouTube, Google Maps, etc.)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:849
msgid "Lazy Load Background Images"
msgstr "Lazy Load de imágenes de fondo"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:852
msgid ""
"Defer CSS background images (inline style) until they approach the viewport"
msgstr ""
"Diferir imágenes de fondo CSS (estilo inline) hasta que se acerquen al "
"viewport"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:853
msgid ""
"The first two background images are kept eager to protect LCP. Add data-no-"
"lazy to opt an element out."
msgstr ""
"Las dos primeras imágenes de fondo se mantienen activas para proteger el "
"LCP. Añade data-no-lazy para excluir un elemento."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:857
msgid "Preload LCP Image"
msgstr "Precargar Imagen LCP"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:860
msgid "Detect the first image and add a preload hint in <head> for faster LCP"
msgstr ""
"Detectar la primera imagen y añadir un hint de precarga en <head> para un "
"LCP más rápido"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:865
msgid "HTML"
msgstr "HTML"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:868
msgid "Minify HTML"
msgstr "Minificar HTML"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:871
msgid "Remove comments, extra whitespace, and blank lines from HTML"
msgstr "Eliminar comentarios, espacios extra y líneas en blanco del HTML"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:876
msgid "Fonts & Network"
msgstr "Fuentes y Red"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:882
msgid "Download Google Fonts and serve them locally (better TTFB + GDPR)"
msgstr "Descargar Google Fonts y servirlas localmente (mejor TTFB + GDPR)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:883
msgid ""
"Eliminates DNS lookup to fonts.googleapis.com and fonts.gstatic.com. Fonts "
"are cached in wp-content/cache/."
msgstr ""
"Elimina la resolución DNS a fonts.googleapis.com y fonts.gstatic.com. Las "
"fuentes se cachean en wp-content/cache/."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:887
msgid "Additional DNS Prefetch"
msgstr "DNS Prefetch Adicional"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:894
msgid "Auto-detected:"
msgstr "Auto-detectados:"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:896
msgid ""
"These domains are prefetched automatically based on your active plugins. No "
"action needed."
msgstr ""
"Estos dominios se precargan automáticamente según tus plugins activos. No "
"requiere acción."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:900
msgid ""
"Add any third-party origins not detected above (one per line). DNS is "
"resolved and connections are opened before the browser needs them."
msgstr ""
"Añade orígenes de terceros no detectados arriba (uno por línea). El DNS se "
"resuelve y las conexiones se abren antes de que el navegador las necesite."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:911
msgid ""
"Accelerate page-to-page navigation by telling the browser to prefetch or "
"prerender links before the user clicks."
msgstr ""
"Acelera la navegación entre páginas indicando al navegador que haga prefetch"
" o prerender de enlaces antes de que el usuario haga clic."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:924
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Configuración Avanzada"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:928
msgid "Excluded URLs"
msgstr "URLs Excluidas"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:931
msgid ""
"One pattern per line. Regex supported. These URLs will never be cached."
msgstr "Un patrón por línea. Soporta regex. Estas URLs nunca se cachearán."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:935
msgid "Excluded Cookies"
msgstr "Cookies Excluidas"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:938
msgid ""
"One pattern per line. If a visitor has any of these cookies, the page won't "
"be cached."
msgstr ""
"Un patrón por línea. Si un visitante tiene alguna de estas cookies, la "
"página no se cacheará."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:942
msgid "Cookie normalisation"
msgstr "Normalización de cookies"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:944
msgid ""
"A stray analytics or consent cookie can push the edge to pass every "
"anonymous request to the origin. These tools keep that from happening."
msgstr ""
"Una cookie de analítica o de consentimiento perdida puede hacer que el edge "
"mande al origen todas las peticiones anónimas. Estas herramientas lo evitan."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:946
msgid "Check cookies now"
msgstr "Comprobar cookies ahora"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:951
msgid "Cookie-strip VCL snippet (propose-only — review before deploying)"
msgstr ""
"Snippet VCL de limpieza de cookies (solo propuesta — revísalo antes de "
"desplegar)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:952
msgid ""
"Keeps only the Excluded Cookies above and strips the rest before the cache "
"lookup, so a stray cookie no longer causes a miss. The plugin never deploys "
"VCL — copy it into Configuration → VCL on the Transparent Edge dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Mantiene solo las Cookies excluidas de arriba y elimina el resto antes de la"
" búsqueda en caché, para que una cookie perdida ya no provoque un miss. El "
"plugin nunca despliega VCL — cópialo en Configuration → VCL del panel de "
"Transparent Edge."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:960
msgid "Ignored Query Strings"
msgstr "Query Strings Ignorados"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:963
msgid ""
"One per line. These query parameters (UTM, fbclid, etc.) are stripped from "
"the cache key."
msgstr ""
"Uno por línea. Estos parámetros de consulta (UTM, fbclid, etc.) se eliminan "
"de la clave de caché."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:968
msgid "VCL Snippet for Query String Stripping (deploy in TE dashboard)"
msgstr ""
"Snippet VCL para Eliminación de Query Strings (desplegar en dashboard TE)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:984
msgid "WooCommerce"
msgstr "WooCommerce"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:987
msgid "Exclude from cache"
msgstr "Excluir de la caché"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:989
msgid "Cart page"
msgstr "Página del carrito"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:990
msgid "Checkout page"
msgstr "Página de pago"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:991
msgid "My Account page"
msgstr "Página de Mi Cuenta"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:995
msgid "Stock changes"
msgstr "Cambios de Stock"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:996
msgid "Purge product page when stock changes"
msgstr "Purgar página del producto cuando cambia el stock"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1001
msgid "Heartbeat Control"
msgstr "Control del Heartbeat"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1004
msgid "Heartbeat Behavior"
msgstr "Comportamiento del Heartbeat"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1007
msgid "Default (WordPress controls it)"
msgstr "Por defecto (WordPress lo controla)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1008
msgid "Reduce frequency (recommended)"
msgstr "Reducir frecuencia (recomendado)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1009
msgid "Disable everywhere (saves max resources)"
msgstr "Desactivar en todas partes (ahorra máximos recursos)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1011
msgid ""
"The Heartbeat API sends AJAX requests every 15-60s for autosave, post "
"locking, etc. Reducing it saves server resources."
msgstr ""
"La API Heartbeat envía peticiones AJAX cada 15-60s para autoguardado, "
"bloqueo de posts, etc. Reducirla ahorra recursos del servidor."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1015
msgid "Heartbeat Interval"
msgstr "Intervalo del Heartbeat"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1018
msgid "seconds (15-120). Default WP: 15-60. Recommended: 60 or 120."
msgstr "segundos (15-120). WP por defecto: 15-60. Recomendado: 60 o 120."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1022
msgid "Disable in Admin"
msgstr "Desactivar en Admin"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1025
msgid "Disable Heartbeat in the admin dashboard (except post editor)"
msgstr ""
"Desactivar Heartbeat en el panel de administración (excepto editor de posts)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1029
msgid "Disable in Post Editor"
msgstr "Desactivar en Editor de Posts"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1032
msgid "Disable Heartbeat in the post editor (warning: disables autosave)"
msgstr ""
"Desactivar Heartbeat en el editor de posts (aviso: desactiva el "
"autoguardado)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1033
msgid ""
"Use with caution. Without autosave, unsaved work is lost if the browser "
"crashes."
msgstr ""
"Usa con precaución. Sin autoguardado, el trabajo no guardado se pierde si el"
" navegador se cierra inesperadamente."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1038
msgid "Editorial write load (revisions &amp; autosave)"
msgstr "Carga de escritura de redacción (revisiones y autosave)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1042
msgid ""
"Every autosave tick and every stored revision is a database write on the "
"logged-in path, which no cache can absorb. On an editor-heavy site this adds"
" up. These controls are optional and change nothing until enabled."
msgstr ""
"Cada autosave y cada revisión guardada es una escritura en la base de datos "
"en la ruta de logueados, que ninguna caché absorbe. En un sitio con mucha "
"redacción, suma. Estos controles son opcionales y no cambian nada hasta "
"activarlos."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1049
msgid "Apply the revision and autosave limits below"
msgstr "Aplicar los límites de revisiones y autosave de abajo"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1053
msgid "Revisions to keep"
msgstr "Revisiones a conservar"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1056
msgid ""
"-1 = leave WordPress alone (default). 0 = disable revisions. A positive "
"number keeps that many per post."
msgstr ""
"-1 = no tocar WordPress (por defecto). 0 = desactivar revisiones. Un número "
"positivo conserva esa cantidad por entrada."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1060
msgid "Autosave interval"
msgstr "Intervalo de autosave"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1063
msgid ""
"seconds. 0 = leave WordPress default (60s). Otherwise clamped to 60-600. "
"Ignored if AUTOSAVE_INTERVAL is set in wp-config.php."
msgstr ""
"segundos. 0 = dejar el valor por defecto de WordPress (60s). Si no, se "
"limita a 60-600. Se ignora si AUTOSAVE_INTERVAL está definido en wp-"
"config.php."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1068
msgid "Debug"
msgstr "Depuración"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1071
msgid "Debug Mode"
msgstr "Modo Depuración"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1072
msgid "Add debug headers (X-Flavor-Edge-Keys, X-Flavor-Edge-TTL) to responses"
msgstr ""
"Añadir cabeceras de depuración (X-Flavor-Edge-Keys, X-Flavor-Edge-TTL) a las"
" respuestas"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1080
msgid ""
"All invalidation events are registered in the Transparent Edge dashboard via"
" the API. No local log needed."
msgstr ""
"Todos los eventos de invalidación se registran en el dashboard de "
"Transparent Edge vía la API. No se necesita log local."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1085
msgid ""
"Purge events, timestamps, and results are available in your Transparent Edge"
" dashboard:"
msgstr ""
"Los eventos de purga, marcas de tiempo y resultados están disponibles en tu "
"dashboard de Transparent Edge:"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1088
msgid "View Invalidation History →"
msgstr "Ver Historial de Invalidación →"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1095
msgid "Connect to the API first to access your invalidation history."
msgstr "Conecta con la API primero para acceder al historial de invalidación."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1102
