"muestra tras guardar)."

#: includes/admin/views/tab-security.php:44
msgid "Disable XML-RPC"
msgstr "Desactivar XML-RPC"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-security.php:48
msgid ""
"Disable xmlrpc.php (leave off if you use Jetpack or the WordPress mobile "
"app)"
msgstr ""
"Desactivar xmlrpc.php (déjalo desactivado si usas Jetpack o la app móvil de "
"WordPress)"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-security.php:53
