msgstr "Alternativa PHP"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-security.php:115
msgid ""
"Emit these headers from WordPress (use if you cannot apply the VCL snippet)"
msgstr ""
"Emitir estas cabeceras desde WordPress (úsalo si no puedes aplicar el "
"snippet VCL)"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-security.php:125
msgid "Recommended VCL snippet"
msgstr "Snippet VCL recomendado"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-security.php:126
msgid ""
"Copy and deploy from your Transparent Edge dashboard. The plugin never "
"deploys VCL automatically."
msgstr ""
"Copia y despliega desde tu dashboard de Transparent Edge. El plugin nunca "
"despliega VCL automáticamente."

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:39
msgid "Enable Speculation Rules"
msgstr "Activar Speculation Rules"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:43
msgid "Inject Speculation Rules header for faster page-to-page navigation"
msgstr ""
"Inyectar la cabecera Speculation Rules para acelerar la navegación entre "
"páginas"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:46
msgid ""
"Tells modern browsers (Chrome 109+) to prefetch or prerender links before "
"the user clicks. Progressive enhancement — ignored by unsupported browsers."
msgstr ""
"Indica a navegadores modernos (Chrome 109+) que hagan prefetch o prerender "
"de enlaces antes de que el usuario haga clic. Mejora progresiva — los "
"navegadores sin soporte lo ignoran."

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:52
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Modo"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:57
msgid "Conservative"
msgstr "Conservador"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:58
msgid ""
"Prefetch on click/pointerdown only. Lowest origin load. Recommended for "
"high-traffic sites and sites with a dedicated mid-tier."
msgstr ""
"Prefetch solo al hacer clic. Menor carga al origen. Recomendado para sitios "
"de alto tráfico y con mid-tier dedicado."

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:62
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Equilibrado"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:63
msgid ""
"Prefetch on hover. Good balance between speed and origin load. Recommended "
"for most sites."
msgstr ""
"Prefetch al pasar el ratón. Buen equilibrio entre velocidad y carga al "
"origen. Recomendado para la mayoría de sitios."

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:67
msgid "Aggressive"
msgstr "Agresivo"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:68
msgid ""
"Prefetch on hover + prerender on click. Fastest navigation, but runs "
"JavaScript on speculative pages."
msgstr ""
"Prefetch al pasar el ratón + prerender al hacer clic. Navegación más rápida,"
" pero ejecuta JavaScript en páginas especulativas."

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:75
msgid "⚠ Important: Aggressive mode runs JavaScript on speculative pages."
msgstr ""
"⚠ Importante: El modo Agresivo ejecuta JavaScript en páginas especulativas."

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:77
msgid ""
"This can trigger analytics, remarketing pixels (Facebook, LinkedIn, Criteo),"
" and third-party API calls before the user actually visits the page. Make "
"sure your analytics implementation filters requests with the Sec-Purpose: "
"prefetch header before enabling this mode."
msgstr ""
"Esto puede disparar analytics, píxeles de remarketing (Facebook, LinkedIn, "
"Criteo) y llamadas a APIs de terceros antes de que el usuario visite la "
"página. Asegúrate de que tu implementación de analytics filtra peticiones "
"con la cabecera Sec-Purpose: prefetch antes de activar este modo."

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:84
msgid "Post types to prefetch"
msgstr "Tipos de contenido a prefetchear"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:95
msgid ""
"Only links to these post types will be prefetched. Unchecked types are "
"excluded from speculation."
msgstr ""
"Solo los enlaces a estos tipos de contenido se prefetchearán. Los tipos "
"desmarcados se excluyen de la especulación."

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:101
msgid "Header injection"
msgstr "Inyección de cabecera"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:106
msgid "Inline (recommended)"
msgstr "Inline (recomendado)"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:107
msgid ""
"Rules are written into the page &lt;head&gt;, inside the HTML the edge "
"already caches. No separate request, so nothing hits the origin to hand out "
"the rules."
msgstr ""
"Las reglas se escriben en el &lt;head&gt; de la página, dentro del HTML que "
"el edge ya cachea. Sin petición aparte, así que nada pega al origen para "
"entregar las reglas."

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:111
msgid ""
"PHP header &rarr; endpoint — a Speculation-Rules header points the browser "
"to /wp-json/. The browser fetches it on every navigation, so it MUST be "
"cached at the edge or it hits the origin on each miss. Use only for very "
"large rule sets."
msgstr ""
"Cabecera PHP &rarr; endpoint — una cabecera Speculation-Rules apunta el "
"navegador a /wp-json/. El navegador la pide en cada navegación, así que DEBE"
" estar cacheada en el edge o pegará al origen en cada miss. Úsalo solo para "
"conjuntos de reglas muy grandes."

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:115
msgid ""
"VCL (edge) — header added by Varnish. Same endpoint caveat as PHP above."
msgstr ""
"VCL (edge) — cabecera añadida por Varnish. Mismo matiz del endpoint que en "
"PHP arriba."

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:120
msgid ""
"Copy the VCL snippet below and deploy it from your Transparent Edge "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Copia el snippet VCL de abajo y despliégalo desde tu dashboard de "
"Transparent Edge."

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:128
msgid "VCL Snippet"
msgstr "Snippet VCL"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:141
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Vista previa"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:145
msgid "View generated JSON"
msgstr "Ver JSON generado"

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:148
msgid ""
"Open Chrome DevTools → Application → Speculative loads to verify rules are "
"active."
msgstr ""
"Abre Chrome DevTools → Application → Speculative loads para verificar que "
"las reglas están activas."

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:152
msgid "Enable Speculation Rules to preview the generated JSON."
msgstr "Activa Speculation Rules para ver una vista previa del JSON generado."

#: includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:170
msgid ""
"⚠ Aggressive mode runs JavaScript on speculative pages.\n"
"\n"
"This can trigger analytics, remarketing pixels, and third-party API calls before the user visits the page.\n"
"\n"
"Make sure your analytics filters requests with Sec-Purpose: prefetch.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"⚠ El modo Agresivo ejecuta JavaScript en páginas especulativas.\n"
"\n"
"Esto puede disparar analytics, píxeles de remarketing y llamadas a APIs de terceros antes de que el usuario visite la página.\n"
"\n"
"Asegúrate de que tu analytics filtra peticiones con Sec-Purpose: prefetch.\n"
"\n"
"¿Deseas continuar?"

